          "id": "d20-title",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Juniper Telecom — Q4 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Juniper Telecom — Q4 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d20-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d20-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The following pages present Juniper Telecom's Q4 2025 operating review. The period was characterised by record retention and slower hiring; management attention centred on fixed wireless broadband fundamentals, cost discipline and platform reliability.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d20-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The Payments platform is owned by the Platform team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Kwame Mensah, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 74.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d20-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "All figures in this section are rounded; totals may not sum exactly.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 92.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d20-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 103.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d20-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The table below breaks down performance by sales region. Growth is measured against the prior quarter in constant currency, and churn counts customers who did not renew during the period.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 118.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
