        {
          "id": "d20-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For Q1 2026 the plan assumes modest sequential growth with flat headcount. The board approved a capital expenditure budget of $19.5M for Q1 2026, weighted towards warehouse automation.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 97.4
